() Tj T*
(A large number of poisonous substances, among which lead may be) Tj T*
(included, are not equally poisonous in the same dose for all persons.) Tj T*
(It is customary to speak of those persons who show a diminished) Tj T*
(resistance, or whose tissues show little power of resisting the) Tj T*
(poisonous effects of such substances, as susceptible. On the other) Tj T*
(hand, it is possible, but not scientifically correct, to speak of) Tj T*
(immunity to such poisonous substances. Persons, particularly, who) Tj T*
(resist lead poisoning to a greater degree than their fellows are better) Tj T*
(spoken of as tolerant of the poisonous effects than as being partially) Tj T*
(immune.) Tj T*
