(tolerant of the metal takes place through the medium of the bowel, and) Tj T*
(that probably those individuals who are engaged in what are recognized) Tj T*
(as dangerous processes in lead industries, and yet show no signs of) Tj T*
(illness, have established a kind of balance between the intake of the) Tj T*
(poison and its excretion by the bowel. It is rarely possible in such) Tj T*
(persons to find any lead excreted through the kidney. Occasionally,) Tj T*
