(in the routine examination of lead workers is that, although a worker) Tj T*
(may show signs of lead absorption as distinguished from definite lead) Tj T*
(poisoning during the earlier period of his employment, he later shows) Tj T*
(less and less signs of the influence of the poisonous substance; even a) Tj T*
(mild degree of definite poisoning in the early stages of work in a lead) Tj T*
(process does not seriously militate against this gradually acquired) Tj T*
(tolerance, whilst careful treatment during such a time as the man is) Tj T*
