(the vessels here and there in the region of the degenerated nervous) Tj T*
(tissue. Again, even the histological action of a drug such as amyl) Tj T*
(nitrite points to involvement of the vaso-motor system. Perhaps) Tj T*
(this curious association through all the described pathology and) Tj T*
