(tissue.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(A further important fact was noticeable in animals Nos. 21 and 22) Tj T*
(\(see p. 101\), which had been exposed to a low solubility glaze such) Tj T*
(as is used in the Potteries. Low solubility glaze is compounded with) Tj T*
