(solubility glaze, which contained white lead as opposed to lead frit,) Tj T*
(no such pneumonic or fibroid changes were found. This point is of some) Tj T*
(pathological importance.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The inhalation experiments also throw some light on the quantity of) Tj T*
(lead necessary to produce poisoning. The animals in the inhalation) Tj T*
(experiments were exposed for varying periods, and constant estimations) Tj T*
(made of the lead present in the air. In a number of instances samples) Tj T*
(were taken from the cage air during the whole of the experiment, as) Tj T*
