(feeding, and the exposure to lead continued after the alcohol was) Tj T*
(given. In addition to high solubility glazes, white lead, and flue) Tj T*
(dust, a soluble salt of lead was also used, in one series the salt) Tj T*
(being the nitrate. 0·1 gramme was given daily; and it is these two) Tj T*
