(poisonousness was found, but by washing the frit with two or three) Tj T*
(changes of dilute acetic acid \(3 per cent.\), and then with distilled) Tj T*
(water, no pathological results followed inoculation. Water-washing) Tj T*
(frit alone definitely reduces the poisonous effect, but not to the) Tj T*
