(muscle, suffers early, and a curious facial contour is produced, two) Tj T*
(well-marked folds being seen--one the ordinary naso-labial fold, and) Tj T*
(the other situated at the anterior margin of the masseter. This,) Tj T*
(together with the loss of the orbital fat, gives the face a curious) Tj T*
(pinched appearance. Such a pinched appearance is also to be found in) Tj T*
(animals \(cats\) poisoned by lead. The wasting frequently precedes any) Tj T*
(other symptoms, and it is no uncommon thing to find that a man who has) Tj T*
(been working in a lead process exposing him to inhalation of dust for) Tj T*
(a year is losing weight. In one case a man of 10 stone 7 pounds was) Tj T*
