(with no staining of the cheeks around or of the gum margins, although) Tj T*
(his teeth in these regions were coated with foul tartar. If the lead) Tj T*
(in this instance gained access through the mouth, why should it have) Tj T*
(been deposited merely upon the cheek in this one situation, despite) Tj T*
(the fact that several other situations in the mouth exhibited the) Tj T*
