(nature of their work \(painters, plumbers, etc.\), were liable to lead) Tj T*
(impregnation, 19 had signs of poisoning upon admission, whilst 22 had a) Tj T*
(distinct history of lead poisoning at some time or other. He gives the) Tj T*
(following analysis of the mental condition:) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(  Mania                            37) Tj T*
