(magnesium, when used, must be bright and free from oxide. The delicacy) Tj T*
(of the method has been tested with aqueous solutions containing known) Tj T*
(quantities of lead, also with normal urine to which known quantities of) Tj T*
(lead have been added. In all cases a control experiment was performed) Tj T*
(to insure the freedom of the materials from lead. Lead has been) Tj T*
