(Trillet?s. This method is based upon the fact that peroxide of lead,) Tj T*
(when mixed with tetramethyl of diphenyl-methylen, gives in acetic acid) Tj T*
(solution a fine blue coloration. Unfortunately, a number of other) Tj T*
(peroxides give the same blue coloration, amongst them manganese,) Tj T*
