(it is very difficult to remove the last traces of the substances) Tj T*
(which give a blue coloration in addition to lead. One of us \(K. W.) Tj T*
(G.\) has made extensive trials with this method, as, if it had been a) Tj T*
(reliable process, it would have been one which would have considerably) Tj T*
