(The objections raised against this process are that some important) Tj T*
(poisons--such, for instance, as arsenic and antimony, specially the) Tj T*
(former--are liable to escape partially in the form of vapour, and that) Tj T*
(others, such as lead and silver, may remain as insoluble precipitates) Tj T*
(on the filter. As regards the first objection, it is to be observed) Tj T*
