(With regard to the drinks supplied to workers in lead factories, it) Tj T*
(is highly important that some form of fluid should be supplied which) Tj T*
(the men may drink without harm, particularly in the more laborious) Tj T*
(forms of employment, and, above all, in the factories where smelting,) Tj T*
