() Tj T*
(=The Treatment of Lead Poisoning.=--The treatment of definite lead) Tj T*
(poisoning, as the treatment of lead absorption, is directed towards) Tj T*
(the elimination of the poison, the promotion of repair to the damaged) Tj T*
(tissues, and special treatment directed towards those special organs) Tj T*
(which suffer mostly in lead poisoning. At the same time, special) Tj T*
(treatment of urgent symptoms may be called for; but in the treatment of) Tj T*
(the urgent symptoms the fact of the general elimination of the poison) Tj T*
(must not be lost sight of.) Tj T*
