(  an aspirator. The asbestos tube was weighed before and after each) Tj T*
(  test, and the asbestos then treated with nitric acid, and the lead) Tj T*
(  determined volumetrically. In none of the tests made was lead found) Tj T*
(  in the bottle containing sulphuric acid.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
