(injurious fumes or dust; of many regulations having as their principal) Tj T*
(object removal of dust and fumes; and of Section 75, prohibiting meals) Tj T*
(in rooms where lead or other poisonous substance is used, so as to give) Tj T*
(rise to dust or fumes. Unfortunately, owing to the difficulty hitherto) Tj T*
(of accurate collection, only a very few determinations of the actual) Tj T*
(amount of lead dust and fume present in the atmosphere breathed have) Tj T*
(been made. This lends peculiar value to a series of investigations by) Tj T*
