(suction has to be set up in a system of narrow ducts by means of a) Tj T*
(centrifugal fan--_i.e._, a fan-wheel formed by a number of vanes) Tj T*
(attached to an axle mounted in a spiral-shaped casing--so that when) Tj T*
(the wheel rotates air is carried along by the vanes, and flies off) Tj T*
(tangentially into the space between the blades and the casing, and) Tj T*
