(of the main duct close to the fan about 20 inches. The special points) Tj T*
(we have considered as to entrance of all branch ducts into the main) Tj T*
(duct tangentially, gradual tapering of the main trunk, and collection) Tj T*
(of the dust in filter-bags, are noticeable. Further, when one set of) Tj T*
(rollers is not in use the raising of the hood automatically cuts off) Tj T*
