(  LEAD POISONING: HOW CAUSED AND HOW BEST PREVENTED.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(  Unless great care is taken, work in lead and lead compounds is) Tj T*
(  injurious to health, because the lead enters the system and causes) Tj T*
(  lead poisoning.) Tj T*
