(  lead-workers.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(  Experience shows that the habits and home life of the workers) Tj T*
(  influence their liability to lead poisoning. Intemperate persons are) Tj T*
(  the first to fall victims. Those who begin work on an empty stomach) Tj T*
(  incur additional risk by so doing.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(  Carefulness while at work, and cleanliness, offer the best means of) Tj T*
(  escaping attacks of lead poisoning.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(  Those who work in lead should keep in mind every hour of every) Tj T*
(  working day the importance of not breathing lead dust and not) Tj T*
(  carrying lead to the mouth in any way.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(  Medical advice should at once be obtained if signs of lead poisoning) Tj T*
(  present themselves.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
