(glazed ware with an oily medium. Colour dusting differs from the same) Tj T*
(only in detail.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Aerographing \(colour blowing\) is the blowing on to the ware, by means) Tj T*
(of a jet of compressed air, coloured glaze, or enamel colour held) Tj T*
