(arduous work entailed the men are specially selected. Despite their) Tj T*
(exposure to lead dust, the majority continue to work for many years) Tj T*
(without marked signs of lead absorption. The management should provide) Tj T*
(a suitable room for the men to cool themselves in the intervals of) Tj T*
(dusting.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
([Illustration: FIG. 14.--The cabinet is shown when dry dusting is being) Tj T*
(done. The casting is worked by tongs through a slot in the side of the) Tj T*
