(poisoning used to be common in the process of polishing cut glass on a) Tj T*
(brush by means of ?putty powder? \(oxide of tin, 29 per cent.; and oxide) Tj T*
(of lead, 71 per cent.\), mixed with water to the consistency of a paste.) Tj T*
(The brush was made to revolve at high speed, with dissemination of) Tj T*
