(displacement of air following the scooping or shovelling out of the) Tj T*
(lead, in filling the pails, and in discharging the lead into the mill.) Tj T*
(All points should, and can, be adequately protected by locally applied) Tj T*
(exhaust ventilation at each one of the points enumerated. A telescopic) Tj T*
(arrangement of the branch duct in connection with the barrel enables) Tj T*
(dust generated in scooping out to be removed as the contents of the) Tj T*
(barrel get lower and lower \(see Fig. 15\).) Tj T*
