(reliance must be placed on substitution of wet processes for dry) Tj T*
(wherever possible. Cleanliness of floors requires special attention.) Tj T*
(Although in all painting operations dust is the most potent cause of) Tj T*
(poisoning, we would assign to contamination of the hands and the eating) Tj T*
