(obtain knowledge how far leadless are replacing lead colours. In the) Tj T*
(manufacture of cornice poles \(in which small industry several severe) Tj T*
(attacks were reported\) the suggestion of a factory inspector to employ) Tj T*
(lithopone was adopted, with entire success. A patent graphite has been) Tj T*
