(Extensive inquiries have been made in recent years in Continental) Tj T*
(countries into the effect of use of white-lead paint in producing) Tj T*
(plumbism, the processes employed, and the possibility of) Tj T*
(substitutes--in Austria, from 1904 to 1907; in Germany, in 1905;) Tj T*
